'' RETURN and 'FUNCTION =' cannot be mixed when the result is a UDT with constructors
'' (fbc 178 and 179); 'exit function' counts as the assignment style, and the same mix
'' over an INTEGER result is accepted. A parameter default that names nothing is fbc
'' error 42.
''
'' LOCATION DIFFERS DELIBERATELY: fbc reports on whichever spelling came second (lines 36
'' and 44), this reports once on the PROCEDURE (31 and 39) -- the fact is about the
'' procedure as a whole, and the two spellings may be anywhere in the body. The
'' undeclared default matches fbc exactly, on line 47.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/return-style-mix.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/return-style-mix.out
